| พื้นที่ | ใช้ตัวนี้ |
|---|---|
| Public/Customer (/shops, /cart, บัญชีลูกค้า ฯลฯ) | `import EmptyState from "../components/feedback/EmptyState"` |
| Merchant panel (report/finance) | `import MerchantPanelEmpty from "../components/merchant/MerchantPanelEmpty"` → `.merchant-panel-empty` |
| Merchant list/403/404 | `.pm-state` |
```tsx
<EmptyState icon={ShoppingCart} title={t("cart.empty")} description={t("cart.emptyDesc")}
  action={{ label: t("cart.shopNow"), to: "/recommendations" }}
  actions={[{ label: "ดูร้านค้า", to: "/shops" }]}
  variant="empty" /* "filtered" | "error" (error ใช้ AlertTriangle + role=alert อัตโนมัติ) */ />
